Package: estimatrZero
Title: Fast Estimators for Design-Based Inference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alex", "Coppock", email = "acoppock@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Alex Coppock [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Alex Coppock <acoppock@gmail.com>
Description: A lean rewrite of estimatr. Provides lm_robust, lm_lin, iv_robust,
    lh_robust, and difference_in_means with HC2/CR2 standard errors. Drops
    fixed-effects demean and Horvitz-Thompson. Fixes weighted R-squared.
